"The swapon action cannot be performed when there are operations pending for "
"the partition."
msgstr ""
"Tidakan tambah silih tidak dapat dilakukan jika terdapat operasi tertangguh "
"dalam sekatan."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2684
msgid "Activating swap on %1"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan silih pada %1"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2685
msgid "Could not activate swap"
msgstr "Tidak dapat aktifkan silih"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2690
msgid ""
"The deactivate Volume Group action cannot be performed when there are "
"operations pending for the partition."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan Kumpulan Volum tak aktif tidak dapat dilakukan jika terdapat "
"operasi tertangguh bagi sekatan tersebut."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2691
msgid "Deactivating Volume Group %1"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan Kumpulan Volum %1"

#. VGNAME from point point
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2693
msgid "Could not deactivate Volume Group"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyahaktif Kumpulan Volum"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2698
msgid ""
"The activate Volume Group action cannot be performed when there are "
"operations pending for the partition."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan aktifkan Kumpulan Volum tidak dapat dilakukan jika ada operasi "
"tertangguh dalam sekatan."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2699
msgid "Activating Volume Group %1"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan Kumpulan Volum %1"

#. VGNAME from point point
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2701
msgid "Could not activate Volume Group"
msgstr "Tidak dapat aktifkan Kumpulan Volum"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2706
msgid ""
"The unmount action cannot be performed when there are operations pending for "
"the partition."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan nyahlekap tidak dapat dilakukan jika ada operasi tertangguh dalam "
"sekatan."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2707
msgid "Unmounting %1"
msgstr "Menyahlekap %1"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2708
msgid "Could not unmount %1"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyahlekap %1"

#. Bug: Partition callback without a selected partition
#. Bug: Not pointing at a valid display partition object
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2772
msgid ""
"The mount action cannot be performed when an operation is pending for the "
"partition."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan lekap tidak dapat dilakukan jika ada operasi tertangguh dalam "
"sekatan."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2785
msgid "mounting %1 on %2"
msgstr "melekapkan %1 pada %2"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2813
msgid "Could not mount %1 on %2"
msgstr "Tidak dapat lekapkan %1 pada %2"

#. TO TRANSLATORS: Singular case looks like  1 partition is currently active on device /dev/sda
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2832
msgid "%1 partition is currently active on device %2"
msgid_plural "%1 partitions are currently active on device %2"
msgstr[0] "%1 sekatan buat masa ini aktif pada peranti %2"
msgstr[1] "%1 sekatan buat masa ini aktif pada peranti %2"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2847
msgid ""
"A new partition table cannot be created when there are active partitions."
msgstr "Jadual sekatan baru tidak boleh dicipta bila terdapat sekatan aktif."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2849
msgid ""
"Active partitions are those that are in use, such as a mounted file system, "
"or enabled swap space."
msgstr ""
"Sekatan aktif yang mana sedang digunakan, seperti sistem fail terlekap, atau "
"ruang silih yang dibenarkan."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2851
msgid ""
"Use Partition menu options, such as unmount or swapoff, to deactivate all "
"partitions on this device before creating a new partition table."
msgstr ""
"Guna pilihan menu Sekatan, seperti nyahlekap atia silih dimatikan, untuk "
"matikan semua sekatan pada peranti ini sebelum mencipta jadual sekatan baru."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2863
msgid "%1 operation is currently pending"
msgid_plural "%1 operations are currently pending"
msgstr[0] "%1 sekatan buat masa ini tertangguh"
msgstr[1] "%1 sekatan buat masa ini tertangguh"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2876
msgid ""
"A new partition table cannot be created when there are pending operations."
msgstr ""
"Jadual sekatan baru tidak boleh dicipta bila terdapat operasi tertangguh."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2878
msgid ""
"Use the Edit menu to either clear or apply all operations before creating a "
"new partition table."
msgstr ""
"Guna menu Sunting, sama ada hendak kosongkan atau laksanakan semua operasi "
"sebelum mencipta jadual sekatan baru."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2893
msgid "Error while creating partition table"
msgstr "Ralat ketika mencipta jadual sekatan"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2913
msgid "Command gpart was not found"
msgstr "Perintah gpart tidak ditemui"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2914
msgid "This feature uses gpart. Please install gpart and try again."
msgstr "Fitur ini menggunakan gpart. Sila pasang gpart dan cuba lagi."

#. Dialog information
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2922
msgid "A full disk scan is needed to find file systems."
msgstr "Imbasan cakera penuh diperlukan untuk mencari sistem fail."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2924
msgid "The scan might take a very long time."
msgstr "Imbasan mungkin mengambil masa yang sangat lama."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2926
msgid ""
"After the scan you can mount any discovered file systems and copy the data "
"to other media."
msgstr ""
"Selepas mengimbas, anda boleh lekapkan sebarang sistem fail yang ditemui dan "
"salin data ke media lain."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2928
msgid "Do you want to continue?"
msgstr "Anda pasti ingin meneruskannya?"

#. TO TRANSLATORS: looks like	Search for file systems on /deb/sdb
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2932
msgid "Search for file systems on %1"
msgstr "Gelintar sistem fail pada %1"

#. TO TRANSLATORS: looks like	Searching for file systems on /deb/sdb
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2943
msgid "Searching for file systems on %1"
msgstr "Menggelintar sistem fail pada %1"

#. TO TRANSLATORS: looks like	No file systems found on /deb/sdb
#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2959
msgid "No file systems found on %1"
msgstr "Tiada sistem fail ditemui pada %1"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:2960
msgid ""
"The disk scan by gpart did not find any recognizable file systems on this "
"disk."
msgstr ""
"Imbasan cakera oleh gpart tidak menemui sebarang sistem fail yang dikenali "
"pada cakera ini."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3231
msgid "Are you sure you want to apply the pending operations?"
msgstr "Anda pasti ingin laksanakan operasi tertangguh?"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3237
msgid "Editing partitions has the potential to cause LOSS of DATA."
msgstr "Penyuntingan sekatan boleh menyebabkan KEHILANGAN DATA."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3239
msgid "You are advised to backup your data before proceeding."
msgstr "Anda dinasihatkan sandarkan data anda sebelum diteruskan."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3241
msgid "Apply operations to device"
msgstr "Laksana operasi ke peranti"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3286
msgid "You are deleting non-empty LVM2 Physical Volume %1"
msgstr "Anda memadam Volum Fizikal LVM2 %1 yang bukan kosong"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3290
msgid "You are formatting over non-empty LVM2 Physical Volume %1"
msgstr "Anda memformat Volum Fizikal LVM2 %1 yang bukan kosong"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3294
msgid "You are pasting over non-empty LVM2 Physical Volume %1"
msgstr "Anda menampal Volum Fizikal LVM2 %1 yang bukan kosong"

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3303
msgid ""
"Deleting or overwriting the Physical Volume is irrecoverable and will "
"destroy or damage the  Volume Group."
msgstr ""
"Memadam atau menulis-ganti Volum Fizikal adalah tidak dapat dipulih kembali "
"dan akan memusnahkan atau merosakkan Kumpulan Volum."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3306
msgid ""
"To avoid destroying or damaging the Volume Group, you are advised to cancel "
"and use external LVM commands to free the Physical Volume before attempting "
"this operation."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menghindari kerosakan Kumpulan Volum, anda dinasihatkan batalkan dan "
"guna perintah LVM luar untuk membebaskan Volum Fizikal sebelum cuba operasi "
"ini."

#: ../src/Win_GParted.cc:3309
msgid "Do you want to continue to forcibly delete the Physical Volume?"
msgstr "Anda mahu teruskan memadam Volum Fizikal secara paksa?"

#: ../src/btrfs.cc:316
msgid "Failed to find devid for path %1"
msgstr "Gagal mencari devid untuk laluan %1"

#: ../src/fat16.cc:35 ../src/ntfs.cc:32
msgid ""
"Changing the UUID might invalidate the Windows Product Activation (WPA) key"
msgstr ""
"Pengubahan UUID mungkin menidak-sahkan kunci Pengaktifan Produk Windows (WPA)"

#: ../src/fat16.cc:37 ../src/ntfs.cc:34
msgid ""
"On FAT and NTFS file systems, the Volume Serial Number is used as the UUID. "
"Changing the Volume Serial Number on the Windows system partition, normally "
"C:, might invalidate the WPA key. An invalid WPA key will prevent login "
"until you reactivate Windows."
msgstr ""
"Pada sistem fail FAT dan NTFS, Nombor Siri Volum digunakan sebagai UUID. "
"Pengubahan Nombor Siri Volum pada sekatan sistem Windows, biasanya C:, "
"mungkin menidak-sahkan kunci WPA. Kunci WPA tidak sah akan menghalang daftar "
"masuk sehinggalah anda aktifkan semula Windows."

#: ../src/fat16.cc:41 ../src/ntfs.cc:40
msgid ""
"Changing the UUID on external storage media and non-system partitions is "
"usually safe, but guarantees cannot be given."
msgstr ""
"Mengubah UUID pada media storan luar dan sekatan bukan-sistem biasanya "
"selamat, tetapi tiada jaminan diberikan."

